{"id":"nchi-0b5987","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-690f9259-3683-48cb-848a-7dff46cf80ad","text":"Fixed by nchi-d952cb (merged `93c43ec`). The message is now passed at launch (`layout.apply` with `command: [\"claude\", message]`), so Claude holds it through the trust question; Nocchi shows the agent as needing you meanwhile."},"created_at":"2026-10-02T08:07:22.373916Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"nchi-6b5dc7","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-3bf8144e-b784-4430-bf43-45b519315074","text":"Fixed by nchi-d952cb (merged `93c43ec`). Agents no longer get a Herdr agent name (no `agent.start`), so nothing can clash. A workspace already open in the folder is reused: the agent opens in a new tab there, named after the message."},"created_at":"2026-10-02T08:07:22.399361Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
