{"id":"nchi-448189","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-99ffdb49-f7eb-4405-96ca-2a9f0a32d2b2","text":"Implemented as specced. In the panel's `didResignKey` handler, after closing the field, the notch collapses at once via `setMode(.collapsed)` when the pointer is outside `hitRect` and nothing holds it open. `setMode` cancels the delayed collapse that `promptChanged(.none)` schedules. Esc, Home and sending are unchanged. `swift build` and `swift test` pass (140 tests). App rebuilt from the worktree and relaunched for manual testing."},"created_at":"2026-10-02T09:08:33.868451Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
