{"id":"nchi-448189","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e133d726-b673-4566-9d8a-79476b0fc6ee","text":"Revision: Esc with the pointer away now also collapses in one motion. Both dismissals go through the new `NotchModel.dismissComposer()`, which calls `onDismissComposer`. That is wired to `NotchController.collapseIfAway()`. Home and a finished send still set `prompt = .none` directly, so they keep the shrink-back. The spec is updated. Build and tests pass (140), and the app has been relaunched."},"created_at":"2026-10-02T09:11:54.12301Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
