{"id":"nchi-acbee0","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-fa54a6c3-9d31-4471-805d-1cf601379b28","text":"Implemented as specced.\n\n- `ClaudeAdapter.isHerdrPaneAgent(ancestors:)` is a pure rule. It skips shells (a leading `-` for login shells is stripped) and calls the session Herdr's only if the first non-shell ancestor is `herdr`. `ProcessContext` uses it instead of \"any ancestor is herdr\". `ClaudeSessionTracker` logic is unchanged; only its doc comment changed.\n- Test `onlyAPanesOwnClaudeIsHerdrs` covers 4 chains: `claude → -zsh → herdr` and `claude → herdr` are Herdr's; `claude → xpo → -zsh → herdr` and `claude → -zsh → login` are not.\n- `swift test`: 141 tests pass.\n- Not yet checked in the running app."},"created_at":"2026-10-15T21:52:17.280315Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.299 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"nchi-266732","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Stable local code signing for Nocchi.app, with ad hoc fallback","description":"Every rebuild is signed ad hoc today, so macOS treats each build as a new app and the Accessibility grant resets.\n\nPort colorsip's `create-signing-cert.sh`: a self-signed code-signing identity, **\"Local App Signing\"**, in the login keychain. The identity is shared with AgentSpaces (and later colorsip). `scripts/bundle.sh` signs with it when it exists, otherwise ad hoc with a warning. Add `make signing-cert` and `make reset-permissions`.\n\nThis is not notarization. Other users still go through right-click → Open.","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a0","labels":["task","infra"]},"created_at":"2026-10-16T08:14:36.848585Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.301 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"nchi-651214","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Export Nocchi modules as library products and split NocchiMascot out of NocchiUI","description":"Prep for reusing Nocchi's business logic in AgentSpaces via `.package(path: \"../nocchi\")` (a git URL with a version tag later).\n\n| Product | Contents | AgentSpaces uses it for |\n|---|---|---|\n| NocchiCore | Agent types, AgentAdapter, store, reducer, mocks | Agent state for each project card |\n| NocchiTerminals | Process tree, terminal host lookup, WindowRaiser | Finding and raising a project's windows |\n| NocchiClaude, NocchiHerdr | The adapters | Live sources |\n| NocchiMascot (split out of NocchiUI) | Face renderer and moods | The same faces on the grid cards |\n\nNocchiMascot is the only real refactor. Everything else is mostly adding `public` where it's missing.","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a1","labels":["task"]},"created_at":"2026-10-16T08:14:36.868447Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.301 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
