{"id":"nchi-d320c5","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Expose each agent's terminal window (AgentHost + WindowRaiser.windowID) for AgentSpaces","description":"AgentSpaces wants to put each agent in the workspace of the terminal window it runs in. Nocchi already knows the terminal app pid and title hints privately (ClaudeAdapter `hosts`, HerdrTracker `windowHints`).\n\n- [ ] NocchiCore: `AgentHost { pid, windowHints }` and `AgentInfo.host: AgentHost?`\n- [ ] Fill it in ClaudeSessionTracker / HerdrTracker, updated as it changes\n- [ ] NocchiTerminals: `WindowRaiser.windowID(in:matching:) -\u003e CGWindowID?`, read-only, sharing matching with `raise`\n- [ ] Tests (bestMatch-level resolver tests, tracker host tests)\n- [ ] README/PLAN one-liners","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a0","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-10-16T12:16:01.069752Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.301 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
